{"id":"n29590-1-21","stage":1,"title":"쓰레기 · 垃圾","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29590-1-21-1","ko":"자, 청소를 시작해 볼까?","zh":"好了，我们开始打扫吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자,","meaning":"那","explanation":"자：那。","readings":[{"term":"자","audio":"/audio/34f404d9d0a79aa558ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25945","senseId":"1","lemma":"자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자","audio":"/audio/34f404d9d0a79aa558ba.mp3"}},{"text":"청소를","meaning":"打扫，清扫，扫除","explanation":"청소：打扫，清扫，扫除；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"청소","audio":"/audio/8049e4b9139d36bf5db4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32789","senseId":"1","lemma":"청소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"청소를","audio":"/audio/34e25f83dc2e31e6efd2.mp3"}},{"text":"시작해","meaning":"开始","explanation":"시작하다：开始；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"시작하다","audio":"/audio/93e3308b9dd20149a4c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66567","senseId":"1","lemma":"시작하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시작해","audio":"/audio/24e28dae5b1a91013392.mp3"}},{"text":"볼까?","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼까","audio":"/audio/ac480717af809a867fd7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"34f404d9d0a79aa5","term":"자","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/34f404d9d0a79aa558ba.mp3","entryId":"25945","definition":"用于劝说或催促别人做某事。","pronunciation":["자"]},{"id":"8049e4b9139d36bf","term":"청소","zh":"打扫，清扫，扫除","audio":"/audio/8049e4b9139d36bf5db4.mp3","entryId":"32789","definition":"清除肮脏杂乱的东西。","pronunciation":["청소"]},{"id":"93e3308b9dd20149","term":"시작하다","zh":"开始","audio":"/audio/93e3308b9dd20149a4c5.mp3","entryId":"66567","definition":"完成某件事或行为的第一阶段。","pronunciation":["시ː자카다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d3e348a0a5d919ad2cfa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29590-1-21-2","ko":"응. 나는 쓰레기로 가득 찬 휴지통부터 비울게.","zh":"嗯。我先把那个装满垃圾的垃圾桶倒空。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰레기로","meaning":"垃圾","explanation":"쓰레기：垃圾；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"쓰레기","audio":"/audio/2a2c538e4d404f05e7c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29590","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰레기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰레기로","audio":"/audio/13cb0e2f25327d087c43.mp3"}},{"text":"가득","meaning":"挤满，装满，充满","explanation":"가득：挤满，装满，充满。","readings":[{"term":"가득","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62661","senseId":"2","lemma":"가득","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가득","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3"}},{"text":"찬","meaning":"充满，饱含","explanation":"차다：充满，饱含；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"차다","audio":"/audio/d8eb940a7794fc46db6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37227","senseId":"1","lemma":"차다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찬","audio":"/audio/e3d8eeabff7c4506e9b3.mp3"}},{"text":"휴지통부터","meaning":"废纸篓，废纸桶，垃圾篓，垃圾桶","explanation":"휴지통：废纸篓，废纸桶，垃圾篓，垃圾桶；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"휴지통","audio":"/audio/e4c9ff36de6c1fadb7b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31509","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴지통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴지통부터","audio":"/audio/e515b4b399b2f16192d8.mp3"}},{"text":"비울게.","meaning":"清空","explanation":"비우다：清空；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"비우다","audio":"/audio/e1f74ccf9cd9d475004a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15631","senseId":"1","lemma":"비우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비울게","audio":"/audio/969ac3a393d540a3e884.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"2a2c538e4d404f05","term":"쓰레기","zh":"垃圾","audio":"/audio/2a2c538e4d404f05e7c9.mp3","entryId":"29590","definition":"扫除的灰尘、不能用而扔掉的东西或丢弃的东西。","pronunciation":["쓰레기"]},{"id":"260476e01310cd16","term":"가득","zh":"挤满，装满，充满","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3","entryId":"62661","definition":"事物或人多得没有空隙的样子。","pronunciation":["가득"]},{"id":"d8eb940a7794fc46","term":"차다","zh":"充满，饱含","audio":"/audio/d8eb940a7794fc46db6b.mp3","entryId":"37227","definition":"一定的空间被装得满满的，再也放不进去。","pronunciation":["차다"]},{"id":"e4c9ff36de6c1fad","term":"휴지통","zh":"废纸篓，废纸桶，垃圾篓，垃圾桶","audio":"/audio/e4c9ff36de6c1fadb7b8.mp3","entryId":"31509","definition":"用于扔无法使用的纸或垃圾等的桶。","pronunciation":["휴지통"]},{"id":"e1f74ccf9cd9d475","term":"비우다","zh":"清空","audio":"/audio/e1f74ccf9cd9d475004a.mp3","entryId":"15631","definition":"将内部的东西清除腾空。","pronunciation":["비우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8917dc5a41d2bf662b87.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29590","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":57,"sequenceScore":2.5881,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。我先去倒掉那个装满垃圾的垃圾桶。","办公室失火，一部分东西烧掉了。","好了，我们开始打扫吧？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯。我先把那个装满垃圾的垃圾桶倒空。","好了，我们开始打扫吧？","办公室失火，一部分东西烧掉了。"],"answer":0}]}
